==Important events==
* {{Adv|Red}} attempts to obtain [[HM03]] {{m|Surf}}, but ultimately fails.
* [[Misty]] gives her {{p|Gyarados}}, [[nickname]]d Gyara, to {{adv|Red}} and takes his {{p|Krabby}} in exchange.
* Red arrives at [[Seafoam Islands]], meets {{p|Articuno}}, and encounters [[Team Rocket]].

